# Shell scripts and the Makefile are run by bash/make on Linux CI and in Git Bash on Windows. With
# core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) a checkout would give them CRLF line endings, which breaks
# `bash scripts/*.sh` ("$'\r': command not found"). Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
